  "post_title": "Epicentre guanya el II certamen de rock en viu Rellamp Onda",
  "post_date": "2017-09-24 14:27:45",
  "post_name": "epicentre-guanya-el-ii-certamen-de-rock-en-viu-rellamp-onda",
