  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>(67 fotos) El grup de m&uacute;sica en valenci&agrave; Epicentre ha guanyat el II certamen de rock en viu Rellamp Onda en la final que s&#39;ha celebrat dissabte 23 de nit al Raval de Sant Josep, dins de La Miqueleta d&#39;Hosturionda i en el marc de la Fira de Sant Miquel.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/Epicentre.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Segon ha quedat Colombo i tercer, Kharma. Epicentre s&#39;ha endut el premi de 700 euros i actuar dissabte primer de Fira, 21 d&#39;octubre, abans del concert de Robe al pavell&oacute; V&igrave;ctor Cabedo Carda. Colombo s&#39;end&uacute; 300 euros i Kharma, 200. Ha tancat la vetlada el grup convidat, Enfields, de Vila-real.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrockrellamp/img_8523.jpg\" alt=\"img_8523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrockrellamp/img_8524.jpg\" alt=\"img_8524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrockrellamp/img_8526.jpg\" alt=\"img_8526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrockrellamp/img_8528.jpg\" alt=\"img_8528\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrockrellamp/img_8529.jpg\" alt=\"img_8529\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrockrellamp/img_8530.jpg\" alt=\"img_8530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrockrellamp/img_8531.jpg\" alt=\"img_8531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715